# Vaping Products Duty (VPD)

<%= partial 'documentation/partials/google_tag_manager_js' %>

From 1 October 2026, movements of vaping products under Vaping Products Duty (VPD) must be created and managed using the Excise Movement and Control System (EMCS).

This section explains the VPD changes and the updates required to ensure your software continues to work correctly from 1 October 2026.

